      "y": 0.0,
      "dependencies": [],
      "description": [
        "The world owner claims the free Builder’s Hut plan through K → Construction. Hold it, aim at supported terrain, rotate with R and review placement before establishing the Hut.",
        "The furnished Hut introduces Aldric Stonehand. This shared objective reflects the committed building record; it grants no second plan or resident.",
        "This chapter is a read-only community guide. Kingdom SMP remains authoritative; quest resets and team changes never award coins, items or profession ranks."
      ],
