      "description": [
        "Make the first real First Hearth contribution through the Royal Gilded contribution interface. Accepted resources are permanently consumed after the server validates your inventory.",
        "Tier 1 needs 1,024 logs, 2,048 cobblestone, 512 wheat and 128 iron ingots. Partial donations are welcome. The in-game counter, history and normalized leaderboard show the authoritative totals."
