      "dependencies": [
        "4B534D5000000102"
      ],
      "description": [
        "Complete all four First Hearth resource targets to reach Tier 2. The shared ledger permanently records the highest normalized contributor with deterministic tie handling.",
        "That winner receives the unique Town Hall construction entitlement through Kingdom SMP. This quest only reflects advancement and grants no duplicate reward."
