      "title": "A Promise Kept Together",
      "icon": {
        "id": "kingdom_smp:town_hall_blueprint"
      },
      "x": 0.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "dependencies": [
        "4B534D5000000103"
      ],
      "description": [
        "The winning contributor claims the Hall plan, positions its full hologram, rotates it and reviews the supported site. Review construction in Project, then let Aldric build the furnished headquarters.",
        "Keep its chunks loaded, Aldric’s route clear and the relevant claim permissions valid. Progress survives restart. Verified completion introduces the registered Royal Steward.",
        "Grandfathered worlds retain their completed Founders’ Lodge and Mira Ashford; this shared headquarters objective recognizes that preserved history without converting a building."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "4B534D5000001104",
