      "title": "The Royal Architect",
      "icon": {
        "id": "kingdom_smp:gold_coin"
      },
      "x": 2.0,
      "y": -1.5,
      "dependencies": [
        "4B534D5000000104"
      ],
      "description": [
        "At the completed headquarters, open the Royal Architect marketplace through the registered resident. Earn early coins by selling eligible resources at the exchange within its budgets and quotas.",
        "Review the exact blueprint price and unlock before buying. Only the first successful buyer obtains a primary entitlement; sold-out listings stay sold out. No money is spent on a rejected purchase.",
        "The durable mailbox preserves the purchased building right. Claim or recover the authenticated physical plan from Construction; copied item data cannot create another right."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "4B534D5000001105",
          "type": "custom",
