      ],
      "description": [
        "Construct a purchased Farmer’s House, Builder’s Workshop, Lumberjack’s Lodge or Royal Bank through the normal authenticated hologram and Aldric construction system.",
        "The building becomes public kingdom property after verified completion. The first buyer’s founder recognition remains in the durable purchase record. Services obey their own implemented unlock rules."
