      "description": [
        "Use K → Progression and the live Tier 2 counter to inspect the next community requirements. Donate its eight defined Overworld resource categories and complete the headquarters connection road objective.",
        "An administrator inspects and approves the actual road through the documented command path. Completing the real requirements advances the kingdom to Tier 3; this quest never sets the tier."
