      ],
      "description": [
        "At Tier 3, buy the unique Royal Bank plan if it remains available, choose a supported site and have Aldric complete the furnished Bank.",
        "Visit the registered Banker for reviewed physical coin deposits, withdrawals and in-person financial services. Copper=1, Silver=10, Gold=100 and Platinum=1,000. Remote balance inspection does not authorize a remote transaction."
