      "description": [
        "Complete a real taxed public market sale after the Bank and Tier 3 are established: a fixed-price sale, settled timed auction or filled buy order.",
        "Items are held in server escrow and delivered through the durable mailbox. Normal sales tax is 5%; Master equipment tax is 10%. Timed bidding uses a 5% minimum increase and two-minute anti-sniping extensions.",
